Description: Edukasaun Desktop 0.9.16 - Settings redesign, Login Screen settings and notifications
 Edukasaun Desktop, Eduka-Menu, Eduka-Menu Settings, and Eduka-Panel.
 Redesigned Eduka-Menu-Settings with a working Reset to Defaults and
 instant Apply, a Login Screen page for SDDM, the Edukasaun-Dark system
 theme (Orchis dark), smoother Liquid Glass, a refreshed Eduka-Desktop and
 Eduka-Panel, a resizable Action Center, a notification history and a new
 Edukasaun login screen with live session autologin.
